# Public, build-time values for the Cloudflare deployment. Baked into the client bundle by
# `next build`, so nothing secret may go here (secrets: `wrangler secret put`).
# Set NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL to the real domain before the first deploy — auth emails and the OAuth
# callback are built from it.
